  "postText": "<p><HTML><HEAD><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\"></HEAD><body></p>\n<div align=\"center\">こさめです</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/130/82ce0a1a0cf67c78fdcca63093eaea93..jpg\"></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/130/57e43d4f0f907a14af832f368416bda8..jpg\"></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">タペストリー飾る時、</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">オヌヌメのやつです。</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">紐の扱い難しかったからすごくいい</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">セリアにあったから買ってみた！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">いいねこれ</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">人生変わりました～！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/130/2d67c63dcfa27a10be00d1acb6705a3d..jpg\"></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">ペタグーグミ全人類たべてもらっていいですか？</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">グミって廃盤しがちじゃないですか。</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">でも、、</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">✨ &nbsp; 皆が買えば消えないｯ! &nbsp;✨</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">美味しいヤミー感謝感謝</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">シャンカシャンカシャンカ</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">噛みごたえがいいんですよ</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">歯が鍛えられる。</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">噛むという行為はZ世代の皆さんに</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">とって、</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">必要な</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">ことだと思うんです。</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">ピュレグミと果汁グミに負けたままでいいの？</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">ダメだよね！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">今こそ、皆が動く時‼️</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">こさめ、動きます。</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">一緒に時代を動かそう！！！！！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">おわりです。</div>\n<p></body></HTML></p>\n",
